      "comment": "NANGAR NUGGET (2) hit the frame latest (19.79) when third at Capalaba in a Grade 4/5. Has already won two times from this draw. Expected to go close. ZIPPER ON TIME (8) was below best last time but the start prior was a NG winner in the quickest time on the card at this track over 450m in a NG. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. WINSOME RAMBO (4) has a strong record this trip with two wins and two placings from six starts. Was out of placings last time (30.21) at Dubbo in a NG, finishing sixth and beaten 6 lengths. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. ",
